{"id": "EUVD-2026-87510", "enisaUuid": "67dd9d80-0678-303a-8d00-934e142ad0c7", "description": "OpenClaw Feishu before 2026.8.1 fails to validate whether a configured default account is disabled before selecting it for model tool operations. Attackers can exploit multi-account setups where a disabled default account retains credentials to read or modify Feishu resources through a revoked identity.", "datePublished": "2026-09-26T02:18:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:21:45", "baseScore": 7.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-h2qg-fxpv-82v6", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openclaw-feishu-before-2026.8.1-authentication-bypass-via-disabled-account"], "aliases": ["GHSA-77rw-6qrm-8q2v", "CVE-2026-100540"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d0e77c8d-ad63-38c4-96c6-c028c1f15b84", "product": {"name": "feishu", "vendor": {"name": "OpenClaw"}}, "product_version": "0 <2026.8.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "01b106f4-9c8b-3f32-ae80-ec91e171ddcb", "vendor": {"name": "OpenClaw"}}], "isExploited": false}